  },
  "scope_notes": "",
  "changed_since_previous": "Now disables tests for python-psutil under nsis-x86_64 in addition to python-lief's transitive dependencies.",
  "card": "Updates the Guix time-machine pin and bumps python-lief to 0.17.6 to unblock running Guix builds natively on RISC-V systems. In manifest_gui.scm, it skips tests on failing transitive dependencies (python-psutil, python-pytest-xprocess, and python-sh) for python-lief and nsis-x86_64. This resolves issue #36232 where guix shell failed due to python-msgspec omitting riscv64 from its supported systems.",
